# Code Examples

## Python Example

```python
def factorial(n):
    if n == 0:
        return 1
    return n * factorial(n - 1)
```

## Dart Example

```dart
int factorial(int n) {
  if (n == 0) return 1;
  return n * factorial(n - 1);
}
```

These examples demonstrate recursive functions in different languages.
